$ floe check ex.yaml icon.yaml icon2.yaml script.yaml two.yaml
exit 1
--- stderr
floe: AWS icons are not in $SAMPLE/.icons/aws; run "floe icons fetch aws" (downloads about 14MB from aws.amazon.com) and try again
script.yaml:8:11: js would end its <script> early, or move where it ends, as it holds </script, or <!-- before a <script: split them in a string, as '<' + '/script'
two.yaml:18:15: box "A" overlaps box "B"
two.yaml:20:15: icon "aws/res/amazon-ec2" overlaps icon "nope/x"
two.yaml:21:15: icon "nope/x": "nope/x" needs its icon set in front (aws), like aws/amazon-ec2 (search with: floe icons search <word>)
two.yaml:21:15: icon "nope/x" sticks out of the 200x100 canvas
$ floe render --out-dir $TMP/pages/ex.yaml ex.yaml
exit 1
--- stderr
floe: AWS icons are not in $SAMPLE/.icons/aws; run "floe icons fetch aws" (downloads about 14MB from aws.amazon.com) and try again
